  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.1 (special, agent-ready): adds a structured conversation model and a multi-format parser (OpenAI/Anthropic JSON, ChatML, Gemma, Llama/Mistral, labeled transcripts). RankAndSummarizeChat gains role/turn awareness, a recency window, deduplication, safety-aware skipping, optional JSON/code preservation (KeepJson/KeepCode), post-compression and a hard token budget — all additive via ChatSummarizeOptions (backward compatible). New RankAndSummarizeChatDetailed returns token metrics + the compacted conversation (re-serializable to messages JSON). New AI-agent primitives: CavemanContextWindow (rolling, budget-bounded working memory), CavemanMemoryExtractor (durable memory distillation) and CavemanRelevanceFilter (query-focused, embedding-free context shaping). New CavemanConversationPlugin for Semantic Kernel (summarize_conversation, fit_to_budget, extract_memory, focus_conversation, estimate_tokens). Licensed under the Caveman License (MIT + mandatory attribution); bundled data under Universal Dependencies terms (see NOTICE).",
